summary:
  A search result that is being tried out takes the factor of the saved row
  named last.

history:
  An audition is nobody's saved station, and the row the player was on
  before it is stale by then.

target:
  package/contents/ui/LoudLogic.js

find:
      if (!f || f.preview !== "" || f.episode !== false || typeof f.source !== "string") return "";

replace:
      if (!f || f.episode !== false || typeof f.source !== "string") return "";

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_loudlogic.qml::test_an_audition_an_episode_and_a_file_are_nobodys_subject.
  Line-neutral.
